      "cooked": "<p>Hello everyone,</p>\n<p>I am looking into the general ledger of the supplier, a purchase entry, purchase order and purchase invoice is raised for me.<br>\nI see the total entry is not matching with the closing entry, can anyone help me understand ?</p>\n<p>Regards</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/0/70a4ccddd4ffab9559100dfaf7e8e806ee18000e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/70a4ccddd4ffab9559100dfaf7e8e806ee18000e\" title=\"Screenshot 1404-08-15 at 12.44.51\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/0/70a4ccddd4ffab9559100dfaf7e8e806ee18000e_2_690x151.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 1404-08-15 at 12.44.51\" data-base62-sha1=\"g4uyHaNZnwphLHhkkWDfTHaxMR0\" width=\"690\" height=\"151\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/0/70a4ccddd4ffab9559100dfaf7e8e806ee18000e_2_690x151.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/0/70a4ccddd4ffab9559100dfaf7e8e806ee18000e_2_1035x226.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/0/70a4ccddd4ffab9559100dfaf7e8e806ee18000e_2_1380x302.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F6F6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 1404-08-15 at 12.44.51</span><span class=\"informations\">2518×552 39.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
