      "username": "mithun_frappe",
      "name": "Mithun Kumar Singh",
      "created_at": "2025-11-06T13:39:38.257Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Please find the attached payment entry. Also, you are correct about the amount allocated during payment, it was 60,000.<br>\nIf we look the Total Debit and Credit entry in the last row, shouldn’t it match the closing entry.<br>\nHow the Total Debit and Credit is calculated? I have Categorized by Voucher (Consolidated) selected.</p>\n<p>This the only purchase cycle added in the company and I am not understanding how these are created?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/7/a7eed63c82715a07f1074ad3d08d757dbf087dfd.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a7eed63c82715a07f1074ad3d08d757dbf087dfd\" title=\"Screenshot 1404-08-15 at 14.40.39\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/7/a7eed63c82715a07f1074ad3d08d757dbf087dfd_2_690x467.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 1404-08-15 at 14.40.39\" data-base62-sha1=\"nXBrtA2f4JMEgedmBIkuBYkFXGJ\" width=\"690\" height=\"467\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/7/a7eed63c82715a07f1074ad3d08d757dbf087dfd_2_690x467.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/7/a7eed63c82715a07f1074ad3d08d757dbf087dfd_2_1035x700.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/7/a7eed63c82715a07f1074ad3d08d757dbf087dfd_2_1380x934.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 1404-08-15 at 14.40.39</span><span class=\"informations\">2082×1410 191 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
